#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "What is a Mithqál?"
msgstr "Mithqál em i wanem samting?"

#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "A mithqál is a traditional unit of weight used in the Middle East, equivalent to approximately 3.642 grams. In the Bahá'í Faith, it holds special significance as it is used to calculate Huqúqu'lláh (the Right of God), a spiritual obligation for Bahá'ís to contribute 19% of their surplus wealth after essential expenses (only if the individuals net worth is worth 19 Mithqáls of gold or more)."
msgstr "Mithqál em i wanpela 'traditional unit' bilong hevi we ol i save yusim long Midel Is, we i wankain olsem 3.642 gram. Insait long Bahá'í Bilip, em i gat bikpela mining bikos ol i save yusim long skelim Huqúqu'lláh (Rait bilong God), wanpela spiritual wok bilong ol Bahá'í long givim 19% bilong ol mani kago bilong ol bihain long ol i mas tromoi ol bikpela samting (sapos mani bilong ol yet i gat 19 mithqáls o moa long gol)."

#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "What is the Bahá'í Faith?"
msgstr "Wanem samting em Bahá'í Bilip?"

#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "Why are there advertisements?"
msgstr "Bilong wanem i gat ol edvetaismen?"

#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "Do you have a mobile app?"
msgstr "Yu gat wanpela mobail ap?"

#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "In the works!"
msgstr "Ol wok i wok long kamap!"

#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "Where do the currency and metal rates come from?"
msgstr "Ol mani na metal reit i kam we?"

#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "Gold and silver prices are fetched daily from Swissquote's forex data feed. For each metal, the calculator takes the midpoint of every valid bid/ask quote and uses the median of those midpoints. Currency exchange rates come from FXRatesAPI. The displayed timestamp shows when the latest complete snapshot was successfully retrieved."
msgstr "Ol i save kisim ol prais bilong gol na silva long olgeta de long forex data fid bilong Swissquote. Long wanwan metal, kalkuleta i save kisim namel mak bilong olgeta gutpela bid/ask kwot na yusim namel mak bilong ol dispela namel mak. Ol 'currency exchange rates' i kam long FXRatesAPI. Taimstemp we i soim i soim wanem taim ol i kisim bek laspela ful snapshot."

