#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "The Bahá'í Faith is a world religion founded by Bahá'u'lláh in 19th-century Persia. It teaches the essential oneness of all religions and the unity of humanity. Bahá'ís believe in progressive revelation, meaning that God has sent a series of divine messengers throughout history, including Abraham, Moses, Buddha, Jesus, Muhammad, and most recently Bahá'u'lláh. For more information, please visit <0>bahai.org</0>."
msgstr "Bahá'í bilip em i wanpela lotu bilong wol we Bahá'u'lláh i bin kirapim long Persia long 19 senseri. Em i skulim ol long olgeta lotu i mas i stap wanbel na ol manmeri i mas i stap wanbel. Ol Bahá'í i bilip long 'progressive revelation', mining olsem God i bin salim planti 'divine messenger' long olgeta taim bipo, olsem Abraham, Moses, Buddha, Jisas, Muhammad, na i no long taim i go pinis Bahá'u'lláh. Sapos yu laik kisim moa infomesen, plis go long <0>bahai.org</0>."

